# Moli monorepo · documentation

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for the full rule index (L0–L3).

## Scope

Applies to **all modules** (user-center, order, bi, gateway, knowledge, common, …), not only `moli-knowledge`.

- Doc map: `docs/README.md`
- KB ingest only: `moli-knowledge/kb/AGENTS.md` (do **not** duplicate per microservice)

## draw.io (mandatory for diagrams)

When adding or updating **architecture, deployment, call chain, ER, business flow, or state machine** visuals in any project doc:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/drawio-diagrams/SKILL.md` (or `@drawio-diagrams`)
2. Create `docs/diagrams/moli-{topic}.drawio`, export PNG to `docs/diagrams/png/`
3. Embed PNG in Markdown + link to `.drawio`; update `docs/diagrams/README.md`
4. Do **not** use ASCII arrow art or Mermaid as the **primary** diagram (ASCII only inside `<details>` as backup)

If an existing diagram in `docs/diagrams/` fits, link/reuse it instead of redrawing.

## Single-service docs

First draft in `moli-xxx/README.md`; browse summary in `kb/wiki/services/` after ingest. API authority stays in `docs/api/`.
